# Records docs/demo/taxonomy.gif from a real run: `vhs docs/demo/taxonomy.tape` from the repo root.
Output docs/demo/taxonomy.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1560
Set Height 740
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 22ms

Hide
Type `export PS1='$ ' VIRTUAL_ENV_DISABLE_PROMPT=1 && source .venv/bin/activate` Enter
Sleep 4s
Type `clear` Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
Type `llm-vuln-scanner taxonomy` Enter
Sleep 8s
